播，打赏按年龄分档处理"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/26-09","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"接到侵权通知要及时处理，转送声明后 15 日没有下文就恢复"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/26-10","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"用户信息不要随手放到境外，出境有法定条件和人数门槛"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/26-11","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["11"]},"选服务器先看停机能不能忍，再看有没有人运维，最后才比价"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/26-12","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["12"]},"网站或 App 里的用户信息泄露了，马上补救，通知用户和主管部门，被人攻击的去公安报案"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/26-13","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["13"]},"卖自动续费会员的，开通前和每次扣钱前都要显著提醒用户，取消入口要好找"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page","data-tip-locales":"zh,en,ru,es,ja,vi"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"当前位置"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/book"},"children":["阅读全书"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/book/26"},"children":["第 26 章 · 做一个网站或平台：资质、备案和服务器"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"26-04"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["04"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-a"},"children":["证据 A"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"zh"},"children":["服务器放境内就要备案，App 和小程序上架前也要备案，接入商必须自己持有增值电信许可"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"zh","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["服务器放在境内，开站前就要备案，不花钱，一般几天到几周。没备案先责令改正、罚 1 万元，不改就关站。App 和小程序也要先备案，没备案的，应用商店和小程序平台不许给你上架。"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["备案不花钱。它跟着服务器一起在服务商那里提交，通常要等几天到几周。App 和小程序的备案通过服务商或者应用商店提交，材料齐了 20 个工作日内办完。查一次服务商有没有资质，十分钟就够"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["法规原话是「未经备案，不得在中华人民共和国境内从事非经营性互联网信息服务」。不向用户收钱的网站，只要放在境内，也得先备案。没备案的，责令限期改正，再罚 1 万元。拒不改正的，关闭网站。帮你把服务器接上网的那家服务商也受管：它「不得为未经备案的组织或者个人从事非经营性互联网信息服务提供互联网接入服务」…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"标记：服务器放境内就要备案，App 和小程序上架前也要备案，接入商必须自己持有增值电信许可"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"已做到"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"加入待做"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"收藏"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"分享这条建议"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"收起详情"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["备案不花钱。它跟着服务器一起在服务商那里提交，通常要等几天到几周。App 和小程序的备案通过服务商或者应用商店提交，材料齐了 20 个工作日内办完。查一次服务商有没有资质，十分钟就够"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["法规原话是「未经备案，不得在中华人民共和国境内从事非经营性互联网信息服务」。不向用户收钱的网站，只要放在境内，也得先备案。没备案的，责令限期改正，再罚 1 万元。拒不改正的，关闭网站。帮你把服务器接上网的那家服务商也受管：它「不得为未经备案的组织或者个人从事非经营性互联网信息服务提供互联网接入服务」。替你收钱的服务商也一样。法规说这类服务商「不得为未依法取得经营许可证或者履行非经营性互联网信息服务备案手续的单位或者个人提供接入或者代收费等服务」。意思是没证也没备案的站，正规服务商不许接。再有，机房托管和云主机在法规里叫互联网数据中心业务，宽带接入叫互联网接入服务业务。这两样本身就要许可，服务商自己先得有证。网站主页上不标备案号的，责令改正，再罚 5000 元到 5 万元。App 和小程序从 2023 年 9 月起也要备案。工信部的通知说，在境内提供服务的 App 主办者「未履行备案手续的，不得从事APP互联网信息服务」。分发平台包括小程序平台。通知要求应用商店、小程序平台、手机厂商「不得为未履行备案手续的APP提供网络接入、分发、预置等服务」。省通信管理局收到齐全准确的材料，「应在二十个工作日内予以备案」。备案号要标在 App 显著位置。反电信网络诈骗法也写明，设立 App「应当按照国家有关规定向电信主管部门办理许可或者备案手续」（全国）"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["来源"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["信息产业部 (2005). 非经营性互联网信息服务备案管理办法（信产部令第 33 号，2024 年经工信部令第 68 号修订，第五、十三、十八、二十二条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.miit.gov.cn/gyhxxhb/jgsj/cyzcyfgs/bmgz/xxtxl/art/2024/art_84a0cfa0ebd049bbbe751dca9a008e56.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.miit.gov.cn/gyhxxhb/jgsj/cyzcyfgs/bmgz/xxtxl/art/2024/art_84a0cfa0ebd049bbbe751dca9a008e56.html"]}," ; 工业和信息化部 (2017). 电信业务经营许可管理办法（工信部令第 42 号，第二十、二十四条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2017/content_5240090.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2017/content_5240090.htm"]}," ; 工业和信息化部 (2015). 电信业务分类目录（2015 年版，B11、B14、B21、B25）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.miit.gov.cn/zwgk/zcwj/wjfb/tg/art/2020/art_e98406cd89844f7e92ea1bcf3b5301e0.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.miit.gov.cn/zwgk/zcwj/wjfb/tg/art/2020/art_e98406cd89844f7e92ea1bcf3b5301e0.html"]}," ; 工业和信息化部 (2023). 关于开展移动互联网应用程序备案工作的通知（工信部信管〔2023〕105 号，第二部分第一、七、八、九项，第三部分第二项）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202308/content_6897341.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202308/content_6897341.htm"]}," ; 全国人大常委会 (2022). 反电信网络诈骗法（第二十三条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.spp.gov.cn/spp/fl/202209/t20220902_575631.shtml","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.spp.gov.cn/spp/fl/202209/t20220902_575631.shtml"]},""]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["谈价之前先查服务商有没有证。查证用工信部电信业务市场综合管理信息系统 tsm.miit.gov.cn，按公司全称或者证号查。查网站备案用 beian.miit.gov.cn。没有相应许可的「机房」，出事那天你连找谁申诉都不知道。网站已经备过案的，App 备案只补 App 的信息，不用重填主办者身份。把网站的机器放到境外，确实能绕开网站备案，但想在国内应用商店上架的 App 绕不开。用户在境内、钱在境内，本节第 5 到第 10 条写的那些义务一条都不会少，还多出一层数据出境的成本"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/26-03"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"做直播要网络文化经营许可证，做视听节目的那张证民营基本拿不到"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/26-05"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"让用户上来卖东西，平台就要核验登记、报送信息、留存三年"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/26-01"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["平台不要自己收钱再转给卖家，让钱走持牌支付机构直接结算"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["买家的钱先进你的账户，你再转给卖家，这就是在做支付业务。做这门生意要中国人民银行批准，还要真拿出一亿元本钱。没批准就干，会被关停，挣的钱收走，还要罚款，老板和经…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/26-02"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["收费的网站多数要许可证，自己卖货不让别人入驻的不用，撮合交易的是另一类许可，免费的只要备案"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["向用户收钱的网站，多数要先办增值电信业务经营许可证，这张证个人办不了。广东省通信管理局答复：只在自己网站或 App 上卖货、不让别人入驻开店的，不用办。只开微信…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/26-06"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["用户发的内容你要管：审核机制、举报入口、发现违法立即停传并报告"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["用户发的东西，平台要负责管，注册、发帖审核、评论审核、每天巡查、出事处置都要有制度。页面显眼的地方放举报入口。看到违法信息，马上停止传播、留好记录、报给主管部门…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/26-07"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["提供信息发布、即时通讯服务，必须要求用户提供真实身份信息"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["你的网站能发帖，或者能聊天，就要在用户开通服务时要他的真实身份信息。不给的，不能让他用。直播的规定是后台存真名，页面上显示什么昵称由他自己定，可以用手机号核验。…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/26-08"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["不给未满 16 周岁的人开直播，打赏按年龄分档处理"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["不满 16 周岁的人，不能在你这里注册开播账号。满 16 周岁的要核验身份，还要父母或其他监护人同意。打赏分三档：不满 8 岁不能打赏，8 到 16 岁要监护人…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/26-09"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["接到侵权通知要及时处理，转送声明后 15 日没有下文就恢复"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["有人发来侵权通知，还附了初步证据，你要及时把东西删掉、屏蔽或者断开链接，同时把通知转给卖家。拖着不办，多出来的那部分损失你要和卖家一起赔。卖家申辩了，你把申辩转…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/book/26"},"children":["阅读整个主题：做一个网站或平台：资质、备案和服务器 ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tabbar","aria-label":"主导航"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/book"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-book-open","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 7v14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["全书"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"","href":"/top-50"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"21","height":"21","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-star","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"ta